msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::ifttt::config::create_entry::default\",\"13309276\"]"
msgid ""
"To send events to Home Assistant, you will need to use the \"Make a web request\" action from the [IFTTT webhook applet]({applet_url}).\n"
"\n"
"Fill in the following info:\n"
"\n"
"- URL: `{webhook_url}`\n"
"- Method: POST\n"
"- Content Type: application/json\n"
"\n"
"See [the documentation]({docs_url}) on how to configure automations to handle incoming data."
msgstr ""
"För att skicka händelser till Home Assistant behöver du använda åtgärden ”Gör en webbförfrågan” från [IFTTT webhook applet]({applet_url}).\n"
"\n"
"Fyll i följande information:\n"
"\n"
"- URL: `{webhook_url}`\n"
"- Metod: POST\n"
