#. Lokalise key 182777710; source translation 1406541654; Swedish translation 1406541611; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::google::application_credentials::description\",\"182777710\"]"
msgid ""
"Follow the [instructions]({more_info_url}) for [OAuth consent screen]({oauth_consent_url}) to give Home Assistant access to your Google Calendar. You also need to create Application Credentials linked to your account:\n"
"1. Go to [Credentials]({oauth_creds_url}) and select **Create Credentials**.\n"
"1. From the drop-down list select **OAuth client ID**.\n"
"1. Select **Web application** for the Application Type."
msgstr ""
"Följ [instruktionerna]({more_info_url}) för [OAuth-samtyckesskärmen]({oauth_consent_url}) för att ge Home Assistant åtkomst till din Google-kalender. Du måste också skapa applikationsuppgifter kopplade till ditt konto:\n"
" 1. Gå till [Inloggningsuppgifter]({oauth_creds_url}) och välj **Skapa inloggningsuppgifter**.\n"
" 1. Välj **OAuth-klient-ID** i rullgardinsmenyn.\n"
" 1. Välj **Webbapplikation** för applikationstyp."

#. Lokalise key 184933940; source translation 1422758033; Swedish translation 1422757990; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nest::application_credentials::description\",\"184933940\"]"
msgid ""
"Follow the [instructions]({more_info_url}) to configure the Cloud Console:\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to the [OAuth consent screen]({oauth_consent_url}) and configure\n"
"1. Go to [Credentials]({oauth_creds_url}) and select **Create Credentials**.\n"
"1. From the drop-down list select **OAuth client ID**.\n"
"1. Select **Web Application** for the Application Type.\n"
"1. Add `{redirect_url}` under *Authorized redirect URI*."
msgstr ""
"Följ [instruktionerna]({more_info_url}) för att konfigurera Cloud Console: \n"
"\n"
" 1. Gå till [OAuth-samtyckesskärmen]({oauth_consent_url}) och konfigurera\n"
" 1. Gå till [Inloggningsuppgifter]({oauth_creds_url}) och välj **Skapa inloggningsuppgifter**.\n"
" 1. Välj **OAuth-klient-ID** i rullgardinsmenyn.\n"
" 1. Välj **Webbapplikation** för applikationstyp.\n"
" 1. Lägg till `{redirect_url}` under *Auktoriserad omdirigerings-URI*."

#. Lokalise key 184933943; source translation 1422758216; Swedish translation 1422758173; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nest::config::step::cloud_project::data::cloud_project_id\",\"184933943\"]"
msgid "Google Cloud Project ID"
msgstr "Projekt-ID för Google Cloud"

#. Lokalise key 184933944; source translation 1422758277; Swedish translation 1422758234; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nest::config::step::cloud_project::description\",\"184933944\"]"
msgid "Enter the Cloud Project ID below e.g. *example-project-12345*. See the [Google Cloud Console]({cloud_console_url}) or the documentation for [more info]({more_info_url})."
msgstr "Ange molnprojekt-ID nedan, t.ex. *example-project-12345*. Se [Google Cloud Console]({cloud_console_url}) eller dokumentationen för [mer information]({more_info_url})."

#. Lokalise key 184933945; source translation 1422758338; Swedish translation 1422758295; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nest::config::step::cloud_project::title\",\"184933945\"]"
msgid "Nest: Enter Cloud Project ID"
msgstr "Nest: Ange molnprojekt-ID"

#. Lokalise key 184933946; source translation 1422758399; Swedish translation 1422758356; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nest::config::step::create_cloud_project::description\",\"184933946\"]"
msgid ""
"The Nest integration allows you to integrate your Nest Thermostats, Cameras, and Doorbells using the Smart Device Management API. The SDM API **requires a US $5** one-time setup fee. See documentation for [more info]({more_info_url}).\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to the [Google Cloud Console]({cloud_console_url}).\n"
"1. If this is your first project, select **Create Project** then **New Project**.\n"
"1. Give your Cloud Project a name and then select **Create**.\n"
"1. Save the Cloud Project ID e.g. *example-project-12345* as you will need it later\n"
"1. Go to API Library for [Smart Device Management API]({sdm_api_url}) and select **Enable**.\n"
"1. Go to API Library for [Cloud Pub/Sub API]({pubsub_api_url}) and select **Enable**.\n"
"\n"
"Proceed when your Cloud Project is set up."
msgstr ""
"Med Nest-integrationen kan du integrera dina Nest-termostater, -kameror och -dörrklockor med hjälp av Smart Device Management API:et. SDM API **kräver en 5 USD** engångsavgift för installation. Se dokumentationen för [mer information]({more_info_url}).\n"
"\n"
" 1. Gå till [Google Cloud Console]({cloud_console_url}).\n"
" 1. Om detta är ditt första projekt väljer du **Skapa projekt** och sedan **Nytt projekt**.\n"
" 1. Ge ditt projekt ett namn och välj sedan **Skapa**.\n"
" 1. Spara Cloud Project ID:t (t.ex. *example-project-12345*), du kommer att behöva det senare.\n"
" 1. Gå till API Library för [Smart Device Management API]({sdm_api_url}) och välj **Aktivera**.\n"
" 1. Gå till API Library för [Cloud Pub/Sub API]({pubsub_api_url}) och välj **Aktivera**. \n"
"\n"
" Fortsätt när ditt molnprojekt har konfigurerats."

#. Lokalise key 184933947; source translation 1422758460; Swedish translation 1422758417; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nest::config::step::create_cloud_project::title\",\"184933947\"]"
msgid "Nest: Create and configure Cloud Project"
msgstr "Nest: Skapa och konfigurera molnprojekt"

#. Lokalise key 184933948; source translation 1422758521; Swedish translation 1422758478; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nest::config::step::device_project::data::project_id\",\"184933948\"]"
msgid "Device Access Project ID"
msgstr "Projekt-ID för enhetsåtkomst"

#. Lokalise key 184933949; source translation 1422758582; Swedish translation 1422758539; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nest::config::step::device_project::description\",\"184933949\"]"
msgid ""
"Create a Nest Device Access project which **requires paying Google a US $5 fee** to set up.\n"
"1. Go to the [Device Access Console]({device_access_console_url}), and through the payment flow.\n"
"1. Select on **Create project**\n"
"1. Give your Device Access project a name and select **Next**.\n"
"1. Enter your OAuth Client ID\n"
"1. Skip enabling events for now and select **Create project**.\n"
"\n"
"Enter your Device Access Project ID below ([more info]({more_info_url}))."
msgstr ""
"Skapa ett Nest Device Access-projekt som **kräver en avgift på 5 USD** för att konfigurera.\n"
" 1. Gå till [Device Access Console]({device_access_console_url}) och genom betalningsflödet.\n"
" 1. Välj **Skapa projekt**\n"
" 1. Ge ditt Device Access-projekt ett namn och klicka på **Nästa**.\n"
" 1. Ange ditt OAuth-klient-ID\n"
" 1. Hoppa över aktivering av händelser och välj **Skapa projekt**. \n"
"\n"
" Ange ditt Device Access Project ID nedan ([mer info]({more_info_url}))."

