msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::miflora::issues::replaced::description\",\"199528340\"]"
msgid ""
"The Mi Flora integration stopped working in Home Assistant 2022.7 and replaced by the Xiaomi BLE integration in the 2022.8 release.\n"
"\n"
"There is no migration path possible, therefore, you have to add your Mi Flora device using the new integration manually.\n"
"\n"
"Your existing Mi Flora YAML configuration is no longer used by Home Assistant. Remove the YAML configuration from your configuration.yaml file and restart Home Assistant to fix this issue."
msgstr ""
"Mi Flora-integrationen slutade fungera i Home Assistant 2022.7 och ersattes av Xiaomi BLE-integrationen i 2022.8-versionen. \n"
"\n"
" Det finns ingen migreringsväg möjlig, därför måste du lägga till din Mi Flora-enhet med den nya integrationen manuellt. \n"
"\n"
" Din befintliga Mi Flora YAML-konfiguration används inte längre av Home Assistant. Ta bort YAML-konfigurationen från filen configuration.yaml och starta om Home Assistant för att åtgärda problemet."

#. Lokalise key 199528341; source translation 1576238628; Swedish translation 1576238585; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
