#. Lokalise key 222255311; source translation 1781854967; Swedish translation 1781854744; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::bayesian::issues::manual_migration::description\",\"222255311\"]"
msgid "The Bayesian integration now also updates the probability if the observed `to_state`, `above`, `below`, or `value_template` evaluates to `False` rather than only `True`. So it is no longer required to have duplicate, complementary entries for each binary state. Please remove the mirrored entry for `{entity}`."
msgstr "Den Bayesianska integrationen uppdaterar nu också sannolikheten om den observerade `till_tillstånd`, `över`, `under` eller `värde_mall` utvärderas till `False` snarare än bara `Sant`. Så det är inte längre nödvändigt att ha dubbla, kompletterande poster för varje binärt tillstånd. Ta bort den speglade posten för `{entity}`."

#. Lokalise key 222255312; source translation 1781854968; Swedish translation 1781854804; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::bayesian::issues::manual_migration::title\",\"222255312\"]"
