#. Lokalise key 299592987; source translation 2404061120; Swedish translation 2404060588; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::imap_email_content::issues::deprecation::description\",\"299592987\"]"
msgid ""
"The IMAP email content integration is deprecated. Your IMAP server configuration was already migrated to the [imap integration](https://my.home-assistant.io/redirect/config_flow_start?domain=imap). To set up a sensor for the IMAP email content, set up a template sensor with the config:\n"
"\n"
"```yaml\n"
"{yaml_example}```\n"
"\n"
"Please remove the deprecated `imap_email_plaform` sensor configuration from your `configuration.yaml`.\n"
"\n"
"Note that the event filter only filters on the first of the configured allowed senders, customize the filter if needed.\n"
"\n"
"You can skip this part if you have already set up a template sensor."
msgstr ""
"IMAP-integrationen för e-postinnehåll är utfasad. Din IMAP-serverkonfiguration har redan migrerats till [imap-integration](https://my.home-assistant.io/redirect/config_flow_start?domain=imap). För att konfigurera en sensor för IMAP-e-postinnehåll, konfigurera en mallsensor med config:\n"
"\n"
"```yaml\n"
"{yaml_example}```\n"
"\n"
"Ta bort den utfasade sensorkonfigurationen `imap_email_plaform` från din `configuration.yaml`.\n"
"\n"
"Observera att händelsefiltret endast filtrerar på den första av de konfigurerade tillåtna avsändarna, anpassa filtret om det behövs.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan hoppa över den här delen om du redan har konfigurerat en mallsensor."

#. Lokalise key 299592988; source translation 2404061121; Swedish translation 2404060649; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::imap_email_content::issues::deprecation::title\",\"299592988\"]"
msgid "The IMAP email content integration is deprecated"
msgstr "IMAP-integrationen av e-postinnehåll är utfasad"

#. Lokalise key 299592989; source translation 2404061122; Swedish translation 2404060710; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::imap_email_content::issues::migration::fix_flow::abort::already_configured\",\"299592989\"]"
msgid "The IMAP server config was already migrated to the imap integration. Remove the `imap_email_plaform` sensor configuration from your `configuration.yaml`."
msgstr "IMAP-serverns konfiguration har redan migrerats till imap-integrationen. Ta bort sensorkonfigurationen `imap_email_plaform` från din `configuration.yaml`."

#. Lokalise key 299592990; source translation 2404061123; Swedish translation 2404060771; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::imap_email_content::issues::migration::fix_flow::abort::cannot_connect\",\"299592990\"]"
msgid "Migration failed. Failed to connect to the IMAP server. Perform a manual migration."
msgstr "Migreringen misslyckades. Det gick inte att ansluta till IMAP-servern. Utför en manuell migrering."

#. Lokalise key 299592991; source translation 2404061124; Swedish translation 2404060832; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::imap_email_content::issues::migration::fix_flow::step::confirm::description\",\"299592991\"]"
msgid ""
"In this step an `imap` config entry will be set up with the following configuration:\n"
"\n"
"```text\n"
"Server\t{server}\n"
"Port\t{port}\n"
"Username\t{username}\n"
"Password\t*****\n"
"Folder\t{folder}\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"See also: (https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/imap/)\n"
"\n"
"Fitering configuration on allowed `sender` is part of the template sensor config that can copied and placed in your `configuration.yaml.\n"
"\n"
"Note that the event filter only filters on the first of the configured allowed senders, customize the filter if needed.\n"
"\n"
"```yaml\n"
"{yaml_example}```\n"
"Do not forget to cleanup the your `configuration.yaml` after migration.\n"
"\n"
"Submit to migrate your IMAP server configuration to an `imap` configuration entry."
msgstr ""
"I detta steg kommer en `imap`-konfigurationspost att skapas med följande konfiguration:\n"
"\n"
"```text\n"
"Server\t{server}\n"
"Port\t{port}\n"
"Användarnamn\t{username}\n"
"Lösenord\t*****\n"
"Mapp\t{folder}\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Se även: (https://www.home-assistant.io/integrations/imap/)\n"
"\n"
"Fiteringskonfiguration för tillåtna `avsändare` är en del av mallens sensorkonfiguration som kan kopieras och placeras i din `configuration.yaml`.\n"
"\n"
"Observera att händelsefiltret endast filtrerar på den första av de konfigurerade tillåtna avsändarna, anpassa filtret om det behövs.\n"
"\n"
"```yaml\n"
"{yaml_example}```\n"
"Glöm inte att städa upp din `configuration.yaml` efter migreringen.\n"
"\n"
"Bekräfta för att migrera din IMAP-serverkonfiguration till en `imap`-konfigurationspost."

#. Lokalise key 299592992; source translation 2404061125; Swedish translation 2404060893; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::imap_email_content::issues::migration::fix_flow::step::confirm::title\",\"299592992\"]"
msgid "Your IMAP server settings will be migrated"
msgstr "Din IMAP serverinställningar kommer att migreras"

#. Lokalise key 299592993; source translation 2404061126; Swedish translation 2404060954; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::imap_email_content::issues::migration::fix_flow::step::start::description\",\"299592993\"]"
msgid ""
"The IMAP email content integration is deprecated. Your IMAP server configuration can be migrated automatically to the [imap integration](https://my.home-assistant.io/redirect/config_flow_start?domain=imap), this will enable using a custom `imap` event trigger. To set up a sensor that has an IMAP content state, a template sensor can be used. Remove the `imap_email_plaform` sensor configuration from your `configuration.yaml` after migration.\n"
"\n"
"Submit to start migration of your IMAP server configuration to the `imap` integration."
msgstr ""
"IMAP-integrationen för e-postinnehåll är utfasad. Din IMAP-serverkonfiguration kan migreras automatiskt till [imap-integration](https://my.home-assistant.io/redirect/config_flow_start?domain=imap), vilket gör det möjligt att använda en anpassad `imap`-händelseutlösare. För att ställa in en sensor som har ett IMAP-innehållstillstånd kan en mallsensor användas. Ta bort sensorkonfigurationen `imap_email_plaform` från din `configuration.yaml` efter migreringen.\n"
"\n"
"Bekräfta för att starta migreringen av din IMAP-serverkonfiguration till integrationen `imap`."

