#. Lokalise key 331881883; source translation 2663438146; Swedish translation 2663438041; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::homeassistant::issues::config_entry_only::description\",\"331881883\"]"
msgid ""
"The {domain} integration does not support configuration via YAML file. You may not notice any obvious issues with the integration, but any configuration settings defined in YAML are not actually applied.\n"
"\n"
"To resolve this:\n"
"\n"
"1. If you've not already done so, [set up the integration]({add_integration}).\n"
"\n"
"2. Remove `{domain}:` from your YAML configuration file.\n"
"\n"
"3. Restart Home Assistant."
msgstr ""
"Integrationen {domain} stöder inte konfiguration via YAML-fil. Du kanske inte märker några uppenbara problem med integrationen, men alla konfigurationsinställningar som definieras i YAML tillämpas inte.\n"
"\n"
"För att lösa detta:\n"
"\n"
"1. Om du inte redan har gjort det, [konfigurera integrationen]({add_integration}).\n"
"\n"
"2. Ta bort `{domain}:` från din YAML-konfigurationsfil.\n"
"\n"
"3. Starta om Home Assistant."

