msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::homeassistant::issues::platform_only::description\",\"332098333\"]"
msgid ""
"The {domain} integration does not support configuration under its own key, it must be configured under its supported platforms.\n"
"\n"
"To resolve this:\n"
"\n"
"1. Remove `{domain}:` from your YAML configuration file.\n"
"\n"
"2. Restart Home Assistant."
msgstr ""
"Integrationen {domain} stöder inte konfiguration under sin egen nyckel, den måste konfigureras under de plattformar som stöds.\n"
"\n"
