msgid "Indicates the intensity of the strobe as shown in Table 8-23 of the ZCL spec. This attribute is designed to vary the output of the strobe (i.e., brightness) and not its frequency, which is detailed in section 8.4.2.3.1.6 of the ZCL spec."
