msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::zha::services::warning_device_warn::fields::level::description\",\"349731018\"]"
msgid "The Siren Level field is used as a 2-bit enumeration, and indicates the intensity of audible squawk sound as shown in Table 8-22 of the ZCL spec."
msgstr "Siren Level utgörs av ett 2-bitars värde och anger intensiteten på det hörbara squawk-ljud enligt Tabell 8-22 i ZCL-specifikationen."

#. Lokalise key 349731019; source translation 2812906645; Swedish translation 2812906194; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
