msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::google_tasks::application_credentials::description\",\"398669260\"]"
msgid ""
"Follow the [instructions]({more_info_url}) for [OAuth consent screen]({oauth_consent_url}) to give Home Assistant access to your Google Tasks. You also need to create Application Credentials linked to your account:\n"
"1. Go to [Credentials]({oauth_creds_url}) and select **Create Credentials**.\n"
"1. From the drop-down list select **OAuth client ID**.\n"
"1. Select **Web application** for the Application Type."
msgstr ""
"Följ [instruktionerna]({more_info_url}) för [OAuth-samtyckesskärmen]({oauth_consent_url}) för att ge Home Assistant åtkomst till dina Google Task-uppgifter. Du måste också skapa applikationsautentiseringsuppgifter kopplade till ditt konto:\n"
"1. Gå till [Credentials]({oauth_creds_url}) och välj **Create Credentials**.\n"
"1. Välj **OAuth client ID** i rullgardinsmenyn.\n"
"1. Välj **Web application** som applikationstyp."

