msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::ambiclimate::issues::integration_removed::description\",\"448537472\"]"
msgid ""
"All Ambiclimate services will be terminated, effective March 31, 2024, as Ambi Labs winds down business operations, and the Ambiclimate integration will be removed from Home Assistant.\n"
"\n"
"To resolve this issue, please remove the integration entries from your Home Assistant setup. [Click here to see your existing Logi Circle integration entries]({entries})."
