msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::telegram_bot::issues::proxy_params_deprecation::description\",\"460520854\"]"
msgid ""
"The {proxy_params} config key for the {telegram_bot} integration will be removed in a future release.\n"
