#. Lokalise key 556279707; source translation 4721161212; Swedish translation 4721161105; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::camera::issues::legacy_webrtc_provider::description\",\"556279707\"]"
msgid ""
"The {legacy_integration} integration has registered a legacy WebRTC provider. Home Assistant prefers using the built-in modern WebRTC provider registered by the {builtin_integration} integration.\n"
"\n"
"Benefits of the built-in integration are:\n"
"\n"
"- The camera stream is started faster.\n"
"- More camera devices are supported.\n"
"\n"
"To fix this issue, you can either keep using the built-in modern WebRTC provider and remove the {legacy_integration} integration or remove the {builtin_integration} integration to use the legacy provider, and then restart Home Assistant."
msgstr ""
"Integrationen {legacy_integration} har registrerat en äldre WebRTC-leverantör. Home Assistant föredrar att använda den inbyggda moderna WebRTC-leverantören som registrerats av {builtin_integration}-integrationen.\n"
"\n"
"Fördelarna med den inbyggda integrationen är:\n"
"\n"
"- Kameraströmmen startas snabbare.\n"
"- Fler kameraenheter stöds.\n"
"\n"
"För att åtgärda problemet kan du antingen fortsätta använda den inbyggda moderna WebRTC-leverantören och ta bort {legacy_integration}-integrationen eller ta bort {builtin_integration}-integrationen för att använda den äldre leverantören och sedan starta om Home Assistant."

