#. Lokalise key 630616341; source translation 5540961753; Swedish translation 5540961644; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::network::issues::docker_host_network::description\",\"630616341\"]"
msgid ""
"Home Assistant is running in a container without host networking mode. This can cause networking issues with device discovery, multicast, broadcast, other network features, and incorrectly detecting its own URL and IP addresses, causing issues with media players and sending audio responses to voice assistants.\n"
"\n"
"It is recommended to run Home Assistant with host networking by adding the `--network host` flag to your Docker run command or setting `network_mode: host` in your `docker-compose.yml` file.\n"
"\n"
"See the [Docker documentation]({docs_url}) for more information about Docker host networking and refer to the [Home Assistant installation guide]({install_url}) for our recommended and supported setup."
msgstr ""
"Home Assistant körs i en container utan läge för host networking. Detta kan orsaka nätverksproblem med enhetsupptäckt, multicast, broadcast, andra nätverksfunktioner och felaktig identifiering av dess egna URL- och IP-adresser, orsaka problem med mediaspelare och skicka ljudsvar till röstassistenter. \n"
"\n"
"Det rekommenderas att köra Home Assistant med host networking genom att lägga till `--network host`-flaggan till ditt Docker run-kommando eller ställa in `network_mode: host` i filen `docker-compose.yml`. \n"
"\n"
"Se [Docker-dokumentationen]({docs_url}) för mer information om Docker host networking och se [Home Assistants installationsguide]({install_url}) för rekommenderad och supportad konfiguration."

#. Lokalise key 630616342; source translation 5540961754; Swedish translation 5540961707; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::network::issues::docker_host_network::title\",\"630616342\"]"
msgid "Home Assistant is not using host networking"
msgstr "Home Assistant använder inte host networking"

