msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::stiebel_eltron::issues::deprecated_yaml::description\",\"642507821\"]"
msgid ""
"Configuring {integration_title} using YAML is being removed.\n"
"\n"
"Your existing YAML configuration has been imported into the UI automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Remove both the `{domain}` and the relevant Modbus configuration from your configuration.yaml file and restart Home Assistant to fix this issue."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguration av {integration_title} med YAML tas bort. \n"
"\n"
"Din befintliga YAML-konfiguration har automatiskt importerats till användargränssnittet.\n"
"\n"
"Ta bort både `{domain}` och relevant Modbus-konfiguration från din configuration.yaml-fil och starta sedan om Home Assistant för att åtgärda problemet."

#. Lokalise key 642507822; source translation 5696142078; Swedish translation 5696141637; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::stiebel_eltron::issues::deprecated_yaml::title\",\"642507822\"]"
msgid "The {integration_title} YAML configuration is being removed"
msgstr "YAML-konfigurering för {integration_title} tas bort"

#. Lokalise key 642507823; source translation 5696142079; Swedish translation 5696141701; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::stiebel_eltron::issues::deprecated_yaml_import_issue_cannot_connect::description\",\"642507823\"]"
msgid ""
"Configuring {integration_title} using YAML is being removed but there was a connect error while importing your existing configuration.\n"
"Setup will not proceed.\n"
"\n"
"Verify that your {integration_title} is operating correctly and restart Home Assistant to attempt the import again.\n"
"\n"
"Alternatively, you may remove the `{domain}` configuration from your configuration.yaml entirely, restart Home Assistant, and add the {integration_title} integration manually."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurering av {integration_title} med hjälp av YAML håller på att tas bort, men det uppstod ett anslutningsfel när din befintliga konfiguration importerades.\n"
"Installationen kommer inte att fortsätta.\n"
"\n"
"Kontrollera att din {integration_title} fungerar korrekt och starta om Home Assistant för att försöka importera igen.\n"
"\n"
"Alternativt kan du ta bort konfigurationen `{domain}` helt från din configuration.yaml-fil, starta om Home Assistant och lägga till {integration_title}-integrationen manuellt."

