#. Lokalise key 662424540; source translation 5946706730; Swedish translation 5946706683; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::lyric::application_credentials::description\",\"662424540\"]"
msgid ""
"To be able to log in to Honeywell Lyric the integration requires a client ID and secret. To acquire those, please follow the following steps.\n"
"\n"
"1. Go to the [Honeywell Lyric Developer Apps Dashboard]({developer_dashboard_url}).\n"
"1. Sign up for a developer account if you don't have one yet. This is a separate account from your Honeywell account.\n"
"1. Log in with your Honeywell Lyric developer account.\n"
"1. Go to the **My Apps** section.\n"
"1. Press the **CREATE NEW APP** button.\n"
"1. Give the application a name of your choice.\n"
"1. Set the **Callback URL** to `{redirect_url}`.\n"
"1. Save your changes.\n"
"1. Copy the **Consumer Key** and paste it here as the **Client ID**, then copy the **Consumer Secret** and paste it here as the **Client Secret**."
msgstr ""
"För att kunna logga in på Honeywell Lyric kräver integrationen ett klient-ID och en klienthemlighet. Så här skaffar du dem.\n"
"\n"
"1. Gå till [Honeywell Lyric Developer Apps Dashboard]({developer_dashboard_url}).\n"
"2. Registrera ett utvecklarkonto om du inte redan har ett. Det är skilt från Honeywell-kontot.\n"
"3. Logga in med utvecklarkontot för Honeywell Lyric.\n"
"4. Gå till avsnittet **My Apps**.\n"
"5. Tryck på **CREATE NEW APP**.\n"
"6. Ge programmet valfritt namn.\n"
"7. Ange **Callback URL** till `{redirect_url}`.\n"
"8. Spara ändringarna.\n"
"9. Kopiera **Consumer Key** och klistra in den här som **Client ID**. Kopiera sedan **Consumer Secret** och klistra in den här som **Client Secret**."

