msgstr "Kopiera YAML-konfigurationen nedan:"

#. Lokalise key 681605011; source translation 6184459906; Swedish translation 6184459272; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::mqtt::config_subentries::device::step::export_yaml::data_description::yaml\",\"681605011\"]"
msgid "Place YAML configuration in your [configuration.yaml]({url}#yaml-configuration-listed-per-item)."
msgstr "Placera YAML-konfigurationen i din [configuration.yaml]({url}#yaml-configuration-listed-per-item)."

#. Lokalise key 681605012; source translation 6184459907; Swedish translation 6184459336; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::mqtt::config_subentries::device::step::export_yaml::description\",\"681605012\"]"
msgid "You can copy the configuration below and place it your configuration.yaml file. Home Assistant will detect if the setup of the MQTT device was tried via YAML instead, and will offer a repair flow to clean up the redundant subentry. You can also choose to change the identifiers if you do not want to remove the subentry."
msgstr "Du kan kopiera konfigurationen nedan och klistra in den i din configuration.yaml-fil. Home Assistant kommer att upptäcka om man istället har försökt konfigurera MQTT-enheten via YAML och kommer då att erbjuda en reparationsprocess för att rensa bort den överflödiga underposten. Du kan också välja att ändra identifierarna om du inte vill ta bort underposten."

#. Lokalise key 681605013; source translation 6184459908; Swedish translation 6184459400; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
