msgid "Defines a template to set the state of the lock. The lock is locked if the template evaluates to `True`, `true`, `on`, or `locked`. The lock is unlocked if the template evaluates to `False`, `false`, `off`, or `unlocked`. Other valid states are `jammed`, `opening`, `locking`, `open`, and `unlocking`."
