msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::template::issues::config_format_actions::description\",\"746458776\"]"
msgid ""
"There is an actions option in the template configuration that does not pair with a trigger option. This will be a configuration validation error in 2026.5.\n"
"\n"
"Please add a trigger to the configuration or remove the actions option from the configuration.\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"{config}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"Det finns ett åtgärdsalternativ i mallkonfigurationen som inte hör ihop med något utlösaralternativ. Detta blir ett fel vid konfigurationsvalideringen i 2026.5.\n"
"\n"
"Lägg till en utlösare i konfigurationen eller ta bort åtgärdsalternativet från den.\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"{config}\n"
"```"

#. Lokalise key 746458777; source translation 6903749504; Swedish translation 6903749328; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::template::issues::config_format_actions::title\",\"746458777\"]"
msgid "Template actions option requires a trigger"
msgstr "Alternativet för mallåtgärder kräver en utlösare"

#. Lokalise key 746458778; source translation 6903749505; Swedish translation 6903749392; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::template::issues::config_format_triggers::description\",\"746458778\"]"
msgid ""
"A trigger template configuration needs a trigger and at least one domain when defining an entity. This will be a configuration validation error in Home Assistant Core 2026.5.\n"
"\n"
"Please remove the orphaned trigger from the configuration.\n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"{config}\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"En utlösarmallkonfiguration behöver en utlösare och minst en domän när du definierar en enhet. Detta kommer att vara ett valideringsfel i konfigurationen i Home Assistant Core 2026.5. \n"
"\n"
"Vänligen ta bort den föräldralösa utlösaren från konfigurationen. \n"
"\n"
"```\n"
"{config}\n"
"```"

