msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nrgkick::config::step::zeroconf_confirm::description\",\"792191963\"]"
msgid "Do you want to add the NRGkick device ({name}) at {device_ip} to Home Assistant?"
msgstr "Vill du lägga till NRGkick-enheten ({name}) på {device_ip} i Home Assistant?"

#. Lokalise key 792191964; source translation 7602357703; Swedish translation 7602349381; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::nrgkick::config::step::zeroconf_enable_json_api::description\",\"792191964\"]"
msgid ""
"The NRGkick device ({name}) at {device_ip} was discovered, but JSON API is disabled.\n"
"\n"
"Enable JSON API in the NRGkick mobile app:\n"
"1. Open the NRGkick mobile app → Extended → Local API\n"
"2. Enable JSON API under API Variants\n"
"3. (Optional & recommended) Enable Authentication (JSON) and set credentials\n"
"\n"
"After enabling JSON API, submit this form to continue."
msgstr ""
"Enheten NRGkick ({name}) på {device_ip} har hittats, men JSON-API är inaktiverat.\n"
"\n"
"Aktivera JSON API i NRGkick-mobilappen:\n"
"1. Öppna NRGkick-mobilappen → Utökat → Lokalt API\n"
"2. Aktivera JSON API under API-varianter\n"
"3. (Valfritt och rekommenderat) Aktivera autentisering (JSON) och ange inloggningsuppgifter\n"
"\n"
"Efter att du har aktiverat JSON API, skicka in detta formulär för att fortsätta."

