#. Lokalise key 792542020; source translation 7608627907; Swedish translation 7608627668; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::analytics::preview_features::snapshots::description\",\"792542020\"]"
msgid ""
"We're creating the [Open Home Foundation Device Database](https://www.home-assistant.io/blog/2026/02/02/about-device-database/): a free, open source community-powered resource to help users find practical information about how smart home devices perform in real installations.\n"
"\n"
"You can help us build it by opting in to share anonymized data about your devices. This data will only ever include device-specific details (like model or manufacturer) – never personally identifying information (like the names you assign).\n"
"\n"
"Find out how we process your data (should you choose to contribute) in our [Data Use Statement](https://www.openhomefoundation.org/device-database-data-use-statement)."
msgstr ""
"Vi skapar [Open Home Foundation Device Database](https://www.home-assistant.io/blog/2026/02/02/about-device-database/) - en gratis, öppen källkodsbaserad databas som hjälper användare att hitta praktisk information om hur smarta hem-enheter presterar i riktiga installationer.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan välja att hjälpa oss bygga den genom att dela anonymiserad data om dina enheter. Denna data kommer endast att innehålla enhetsspecifika detaljer (som modell eller tillverkare) – aldrig personligt identifierande information (som de namn du tilldelar).\n"
"\n"
"Ta reda på hur vi behandlar dina uppgifter (om du väljer att bidra) i vår [dataanvändningspolicy](https://www.openhomefoundation.org/device-database-data-use-statement)."

#. Lokalise key 792542021; source translation 7608627908; Swedish translation 7608627732; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::analytics::preview_features::snapshots::disable_confirmation\",\"792542021\"]"
msgid "Your data will no longer be shared with the Open Home Foundation's device database."
msgstr "Dina data kommer inte längre att delas med Open Home Foundations enhetsdatabas."

