#. Lokalise key 810229547; source translation 7847519833; Swedish translation 7847519082; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::influxdb::issues::deprecated_yaml::description\",\"810229547\"]"
msgid ""
"Configuring InfluxDB connection settings using YAML is being removed. Your existing YAML connection configuration has been imported into the UI automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Remove the `{domain}` connection and authentication keys from your `configuration.yaml` file and restart Home Assistant to fix this issue. Other options like `include`, `exclude`, and `tags` remain in YAML for now. \n"
"\n"
"The following keys should be removed:\n"
"- `api_version`\n"
"- `host`\n"
"- `port`\n"
"- `ssl`\n"
"- `verify_ssl`\n"
"- `ssl_ca_cert`\n"
"- `username`\n"
"- `password`\n"
"- `database`\n"
"- `token`\n"
"- `organization`\n"
"- `bucket`\n"
"- `path`"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurationen av InfluxDB-anslutningsinställningar med YAML kommer att tas bort. Din befintliga YAML-anslutningskonfiguration har importerats automatiskt till användargränssnittet.\n"
"\n"
"Ta bort anslutnings- och autentiseringsnycklarna `{domain}` från din `configuration.yaml`-fil och starta om Home Assistant för att åtgärda detta problem. Övriga alternativ som `include`, `exclude` och `tags` finns kvar i YAML tills vidare. \n"
"\n"
"Följande nycklar ska tas bort:\n"
"- `api_version`\n"
"- `host`\n"
"- `port`\n"
"- `ssl`\n"
"- `verify_ssl`\n"
"- `ssl_ca_cert`\n"
"- `username`\n"
"- `password`\n"
"- `database`\n"
"- `token`\n"
"- `organization`\n"
"- `bucket`\n"
"- `path`"

#. Lokalise key 810229548; source translation 7847519834; Swedish translation 7847519146; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::influxdb::issues::deprecated_yaml::title\",\"810229548\"]"
