msgstr "YAML-konfigurationen för InfluxDB kommer att tas bort"

#. Lokalise key 810229549; source translation 7847519835; Swedish translation 7847519210; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::influxdb::issues::deprecated_yaml_import_issue_cannot_connect::description\",\"810229549\"]"
msgid ""
"Configuring InfluxDB connection settings using YAML is being removed but the import failed because Home Assistant could not connect to the InfluxDB server.\n"
"\n"
"Please correct your YAML configuration and restart Home Assistant.\n"
"\n"
"Alternatively you can remove the `{domain}` connection and authentication keys from your `configuration.yaml` file and continue to [set up the integration]({url}) manually. \n"
"\n"
"The following keys should be removed:\n"
"- `api_version`\n"
"- `host`\n"
"- `port`\n"
"- `ssl`\n"
"- `verify_ssl`\n"
"- `ssl_ca_cert`\n"
"- `username`\n"
"- `password`\n"
"- `database`\n"
"- `token`\n"
"- `organization`\n"
"- `bucket`\n"
"- `path`"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurationen av InfluxDB-anslutningsinställningarna med YAML håller på att tas bort, men importen misslyckades eftersom Home Assistant inte kunde ansluta till InfluxDB-servern.\n"
"\n"
"Korrigera din YAML-konfiguration och starta om Home Assistant.\n"
"\n"
"Alternativt kan du ta bort anslutnings- och autentiseringsnycklarna `{domain}` från din `configuration.yaml`-fil och fortsätta att [konfigurera integrationen]({url}) manuellt. \n"
"\n"
"Följande nycklar ska tas bort:\n"
"- `api_version`\n"
"- `host`\n"
"- `port`\n"
"- `ssl`\n"
"- `verify_ssl`\n"
"- `ssl_ca_cert`\n"
"- `username`\n"
"- `password`\n"
"- `database`\n"
"- `token`\n"
"- `organization`\n"
"- `bucket`\n"
"- `path`"

