#. Lokalise key 821040506; source translation 8013639803; Swedish translation 8013639692; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::zwave_js::issues::deprecated_legacy_door_state::description\",\"821040506\"]"
msgid ""
"The binary sensor `{entity_id}` is deprecated because it has been replaced with the opening state sensor `{opening_state_entity_id}`.\n"
"\n"
"The entity was found in the following automations or scripts:\n"
"{items}\n"
"\n"
"Please update the above automations or scripts to use the opening state sensor `{opening_state_entity_id}` and disable the binary sensor `{entity_id}` to fix this issue.\n"
"\n"
"Note that `{opening_state_entity_id}` reports three states:\n"
"- Closed\n"
"- Open\n"
"- Tilted (if supported by the device)."
msgstr ""
"Den binära sensorn `{entity_id}` är utfasad eftersom den har ersatts med sensorn för öppningsläge `{opening_state_entity_id}`.\n"
"\n"
"Entiteten hittades i följande automatiseringar eller skript:\n"
"{items}\n"
"\n"
"Uppdatera ovanstående automatiseringar eller skript så att de använder sensorn för öppningsläge `{opening_state_entity_id}` och inaktivera därefter den binära sensorn `{entity_id}` för att åtgärda detta problem.\n"
"\n"
"Observera att `{opening_state_entity_id}` rapporterar tre tillstånd:\n"
"- Stängd\n"
"- Öppen\n"
"- Lutad (om enheten stöder detta)."

