msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::tplink_lte::issues::integration_removed::description\",\"823722804\"]"
msgid ""
"The TP-Link LTE integration has been removed from Home Assistant.\n"
"\n"
"The integration has not been working since Home Assistant 2023.6.0, has no maintainer, and its underlying library depends on a package with a [critical security vulnerability]({ghsa_url}).\n"
"\n"
"To resolve this issue, remove the `tplink_lte` configuration from your `configuration.yaml` file and restart Home Assistant."
msgstr ""
"TP-Link LTE-integrationen har tagits bort från Home Assistant.\n"
"\n"
"Integrationen har inte fungerat sedan Home Assistant 2023.6.0, har ingen underhållare och dess underliggande bibliotek är beroende av ett paket med en [kritisk säkerhetsbrist]({ghsa_url}).\n"
"\n"
"För att lösa problemet, ta bort `tplink_lte`-konfigurationen från din `configuration.yaml`-fil och starta om Home Assistant."

