#. Lokalise key 826404718; source translation 8085181980; Swedish translation 8085181869; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::bmw_connected_drive::issues::integration_removed::description\",\"826404718\"]"
msgid ""
"The BMW Connected Drive integration has been removed from Home Assistant.\n"
"\n"
"In September 2025, BMW blocked third-party access to their servers by adding additional security measures. For EU-registered cars, a community-developed [custom component]({custom_component_url}) using BMW's CarData API is available as an alternative.\n"
"\n"
"To resolve this issue, please remove the (now defunct) integration entries from your Home Assistant setup. [View your existing BMW Connected Drive integration entries]({entries})."
msgstr ""
"Integrationen BMW Connected Drive har tagits bort från Home Assistant.\n"
"\n"
"I september 2025 blockerade BMW åtkomst från tredje part till sina servrar genom att lägga till ytterligare säkerhetsåtgärder. För bilar som är registrerade i EU finns en [anpassad komponent]({custom_component_url}) som använder BMW:s CarData API som alternativ.\n"
"\n"
"För att åtgärda problemet tar du bort de nu nedlagda integrationsposterna från Home Assistant-konfigurationen. [Visa befintliga integrationsposter för BMW Connected Drive]({entries})."

