#. Lokalise key 858636365; source translation 8602450782; Swedish translation 8602450666; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::konnected::issues::integration_removed::description\",\"858636365\"]"
msgid ""
"The Konnected.io (Legacy) integration relied on Konnected's deprecated firmware and has been removed from Home Assistant. Konnected recommends migrating to their ESPHome based firmware and the corresponding Home Assistant integration by following the [migration guide]({kb_page_url}).\n"
"\n"
"To resolve this issue, migrate your Konnected device(s) to the ESPHome based firmware, then remove any `konnected:` YAML configuration from your `configuration.yaml` file, and remove the (now defunct) integration entries from your Home Assistant setup. [View your existing Konnected.io (Legacy) integration entries]({entries})."
msgstr ""
"Integrationen med Konnected.io (Legacy) byggde på Konnecteds utfasade firmware och har tagits bort från Home Assistant. Konnected rekommenderar att du migrerar till deras ESPHome-baserade firmware och motsvarande Home Assistant-integration genom att följa [migreringsguiden]({kb_page_url}).\n"
"\n"
"För att lösa detta problem, migrera dina Konnected-enheter till den ESPHome-baserade firmware, ta sedan bort alla `konnected:` YAML-konfigurationer från din `configuration.yaml`-fil och ta bort de (nu nedlagda) integrationsposterna från din Home Assistant-konfiguration. [Klicka här för att se dina befintliga Konnected.io (Legacy)-integrationsposter]({entries})."

#. Lokalise key 858636366; source translation 8602450783; Swedish translation 8602450730; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::konnected::issues::integration_removed::title\",\"858636366\"]"
msgid "The Konnected.io (Legacy) integration has been removed"
msgstr "Integrationen med Konnected.io (äldre version) har tagits bort"

