msgid ""
"Follow the [instructions]({more_info_url}) for [OAuth consent screen]({oauth_consent_url}) to give Home Assistant access to your Google Health data. You also need to create Application Credentials linked to your account:\n"
"1. Go to [Credentials]({oauth_creds_url}) and select **Create Credentials**.\n"
