msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::mealie::options::step::init::data_description::parse_todo_edit\",\"947770505\"]"
msgid "When enabled, Mealie checks edited to-do list items to find matches in your food items and identify quantities and units. If it finds a confident match, Mealie updates the food item, unit, and quantity. If disabled, the item is updated as entered."
