msgid ""
"The low speed cover `{entity_id}` is deprecated and will be removed. Use the `speed: low` option of the open, close and set position actions on `{replacement_entity_id}` instead.\n"
"\n"
"Update your dashboards, templates, automations and scripts to use the main cover entity, then disable `{entity_id}` and restart Home Assistant to have it removed."
