msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::bitcoin::issues::deprecated_yaml_import_issue_dropped_currency::description\",\"961660185\"]"
msgid ""
"Configuring {integration_title} using YAML is being removed.\n"
"\n"
"{integration_title} can only be set up once, so the sensor platform asking for `{currency}` was not imported and its exchange rate sensor is gone. To get the rate in `{currency}` back, remove the `{domain}` sensor platform from your `configuration.yaml` file, then delete the {integration_title} integration and add it again, picking `{currency}`."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguration av {integration_title} med YAML tas bort.\n"
"\n"
"{integration_title} kan bara konfigureras en gång, så sensorplattformen som begär `{currency}` importerades inte och dess växelkurssensor har tagits bort. Om du vill återställa kursen i `{currency}` tar du bort sensorplattformen `{domain}` från filen `configuration.yaml`, tar sedan bort integreringen {integration_title} och lägger till den igen med `{currency}`."

