#. Lokalise key 962761750; source translation 10122099541; Swedish translation 10122099302; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::airthings_ble::issues::connectivity_not_configured::description\",\"962761750\"]"
msgid ""
"{device_name} ({serial_number}) has no connectivity set up. Until it is set up, the device only turns on Bluetooth for a short time after its button is pressed, so the Airthings BLE integration cannot read its measurements regularly.\n"
"\n"
"If the device is not in the Airthings app:\n"
"1. Add the device.\n"
"2. If the app asks how to connect, select **I prefer to connect with Bluetooth**.\n"
"\n"
"If the device is already in the app:\n"
"1. Open its settings and select **Reset connectivity**.\n"
"\n"
"This issue is resolved automatically when Home Assistant reads the device and it reports Bluetooth connectivity. Home Assistant tries every {update_interval} minutes."
msgstr ""
"{device_name} ({serial_number}) har ingen konfigurerad anslutning. Tills anslutningen har konfigurerats aktiverar enheten Bluetooth en kort stund när du trycker på dess knapp, så Airthings BLE-integrationen kan inte regelbundet läsa dess mätvärden.\n"
"\n"
"Om enheten inte finns i Airthings-appen:\n"
"1. Lägg till enheten.\n"
"2. Välj **Jag föredrar att ansluta med Bluetooth** om appen frågar hur du vill ansluta.\n"
"\n"
"Om enheten redan finns i appen:\n"
"1. Öppna dess inställningar och välj **Återställ anslutning**.\n"
"\n"
"Problemet löses automatiskt när Home Assistant läser enheten och den rapporterar Bluetooth-anslutning. Home Assistant försöker med {update_interval} minuters mellanrum."

#. Lokalise key 962761751; source translation 10122099542; Swedish translation 10122099366; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::airthings_ble::issues::connectivity_not_configured::title\",\"962761751\"]"
msgid "{device_name} ({serial_number}) connectivity is not set up"
msgstr "Anslutning har inte konfigurerats för {device_name} ({serial_number})"

#. Lokalise key 962761752; source translation 10122099543; Swedish translation 10122099430; snapshot 2026-10-24; live-lokalise-export
msgctxt "[\"Home Assistant Core\",\"core\",\"component::airthings_ble::issues::connectivity_smartlink::description\",\"962761752\"]"
msgid ""
"{device_name} ({serial_number}) uses SmartLink connectivity, which the Airthings BLE integration does not support. In this mode, the device only turns on Bluetooth for a short time after its button is pressed, so the integration cannot read its measurements regularly.\n"
"\n"
"If you want to keep using SmartLink:\n"
"1. Set up the [Airthings integration]({airthings_url}) and sign in to your Airthings account.\n"
"2. In Home Assistant, delete the Airthings BLE entry for {device_name} ({serial_number}).\n"
"\n"
"If you want to use Bluetooth instead:\n"
"1. In the Airthings app, open the settings of {device_name}.\n"
"2. Select **Connectivity**, then **Switch to Bluetooth**.\n"
"3. Press the button on the device when the app asks you to.\n"
"\n"
"This issue is resolved automatically when Home Assistant reads the device and it reports Bluetooth connectivity. Home Assistant tries every {update_interval} minutes."
msgstr ""
"{device_name} ({serial_number}) använder SmartLink-anslutning, som Airthings BLE-integrationen inte har stöd för. I det här läget aktiverar enheten Bluetooth en kort stund när du trycker på dess knapp, så integreringen kan inte regelbundet läsa dess mätvärden.\n"
"\n"
"Om du vill fortsätta använda SmartLink:\n"
"1. Konfigurera [Airthings-integrationen]({airthings_url}) och logga in på ditt Airthings-konto.\n"
"2. Ta bort Airthings BLE-posten för {device_name} ({serial_number}) i Home Assistant.\n"
"\n"
"Om du vill använda Bluetooth i stället:\n"
"1. Öppna inställningarna för {device_name} i Airthings-appen.\n"
"2. Välj **Anslutning** och sedan **Växla till Bluetooth**.\n"
"3. Tryck på knappen på enheten när appen uppmanar dig att göra det.\n"
"\n"
"Problemet löses automatiskt när Home Assistant läser enheten och den rapporterar Bluetooth-anslutning. Home Assistant försöker med {update_interval} minuters mellanrum."

